\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5.7}{\ignorespaces Skew stress analysis of Antiphony under severe class imbalance, showing Macro-F1 resilience across affirmative training proportions from 47.7\% down to 9.8\%.}}{43}{figure.caption.41}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5.8}{\ignorespaces Tokenizer truncation forensic: left-truncation retains proximal conversational context, recovering Macro-F1 from 0.8133 to 0.9331 and shrinking the apparent necessity gap from 0.1600 to 0.0402.}}{44}{figure.caption.42}%
